---
kind: scene
id: rock.thirdMorning
title: The Last Morning
on: arrive
when: "@lastDay"
priority: 10
after: 'visited("rock.secondMorning")'
---

## The Landing, Early

::bg{location="skerry_landing" time="morning"}
::auto{character="hollis" anchor="left" action="fadeInUp"}
@hollis{code="0010"}: Relief boat's tomorrow on the tide. The Board wants your report on it, Inspector, or they'll write their own.
@hollis{code="0020" when="holds('present', ['ada', '_'])"}: And Ada Pell is up and about. Walking the quay like a ghost.
<match on="run.weather">
  <when is="clear">
    @hollis{code="0030"}: Calm as a pond. Could have rowed out here in a washtub.
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @hollis{code="0040"}: Still lumpy out past the Teeth. Keep your report dry.
  </otherwise>
</match>
::clear
